---
import { githubUrl } from "../site";

const evalsReadme = `${githubUrl}/blob/main/experiments/evals/README.md`;
const focusPilotReadme = `${githubUrl}/blob/main/experiments/output-focus/README.md`;

const claims = [
  { figure: "83.4%", claim: "less tool output sent to the model than raw", source: "shipped Focus vs RTK · 12 tasks · 2026-09-21", sourceUrl: `${evalsReadme}#shipped-focus-vs-rtk`, status: "win" },
  { figure: "96%", claim: "of full-output accuracy: 22/24 first-try correct vs 23/24 on raw output", source: "Focus pilot · 12 tasks × 2 runs", sourceUrl: focusPilotReadme, status: "tie" },
  { figure: "9/11", claim: "kept the exact evidence a correct answer needs", source: "shipped Focus · up from 4/11 after a fix", sourceUrl: `${evalsReadme}#shipped-focus-vs-rtk` },
  { figure: "216 ms", claim: "median time for a Focus judgment, 459 ms max", source: "Focus pilot · 12 live requests", sourceUrl: focusPilotReadme },
  { figure: "$0.004", claim: "main-model cost to run three live safety checks: an injection, a benign file, a risky delete", source: "live scenarios · Jev's cost is not reported by its API", sourceUrl: `${evalsReadme}#cost` },
  { figure: "8/8", claim: "runs where a strong model picked the right tool without Select's help", source: "27-tool registry · includes a planted distractor", sourceUrl: `${evalsReadme}#select-vs-self-selection`, status: "tie" },
];

const limits = [
  "Select matches a strong model on accuracy. The win is cost.",
  "The benchmark corpus is curated, not production traffic.",
  "Jev's dollar cost is estimated from tokens. Its API does not report price.",
  "In the Focus pilot, the extra judgment call cost about 11% more per decision than raw output with a cheap downstream model.",
  "A first end-to-end pilot on four small tasks found no overall win yet: a cheaper main model alone beat the full plugin. A broader study is next.",
];
---

<section class="block tight" id="evidence">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <span class="label">Evidence</span>
      <h2>Measured, with the limits printed.</h2>
      <p>Every number came from real captures and real API calls. Pilot results are labeled as such.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="evidence">
      <div class="claims">
        {claims.map((entry) => (
          <div class="claim">
            <span class="figure">{entry.figure}</span>
            <span>{entry.claim}<a class="source" href={entry.sourceUrl}>{entry.source}</a></span>
            {entry.status && <span class:list={["status", { tie: entry.status === "tie" }]}>{entry.status}</span>}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="limits">
        <h3>What we can't claim yet</h3>
        <ul>{limits.map((limit) => <li>{limit}</li>)}</ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .evidence { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.6fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; align-items: start; }
  .claims { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; }
  .claim { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr auto; gap: 18px; align-items: baseline; padding: 16px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .claim:first-child { border-top: 0; }
  .figure { font: 600 22px var(--sans); letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .source { display: block; width: fit-content; font: 13px var(--sans); color: var(--ink-faint); margin-top: 2px; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--line-strong); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .source:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .status { font: 500 12px var(--sans); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); color: var(--ink-soft); white-space: nowrap; }
  .status.tie { border-style: dashed; }
  .limits { background: var(--bg-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  h3 { font: 600 17px var(--sans); }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; display: grid; gap: 10px; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .evidence { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .claim { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
    .figure { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }
</style>
